"n":"0058c","t":"即無復去者令誰住耶如息五"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0059a01","n":"0059a","t":"何以知有二周意耶答上破去"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0059b01","n":"0059b","t":"此口故口可信眼不可信又眼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0059c01","n":"0059c","t":"悟眾生累無不寂德無不圓累"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0060a01","n":"0060a","t":"善惡色心別有人若別有人人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0060b01","n":"0060b","t":"子立人法不受此破別有人體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0060c01","n":"0060c","t":"去者之前別有去法可言法能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0061a01","n":"0061a","t":"當前時去未有後時去至後時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0061b01","n":"0061b","t":"亦收一切二偈為三初偈明定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0061c01","n":"0061c","t":"此即二諦義真諦空故不得定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0062a01","n":"0062a","t":"可取著答若以有心著實相實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0062b01","n":"0062b","t":"既彰則一切法畢竟不可得外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0062c01","n":"0062c","t":"大成鼻根故鼻能聞香觸塵成"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0063a01","n":"0063a","t":"凡夫二乘兩病故說此品凡夫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0063b01","n":"0063b","t":"明六情下半明六塵所以破十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0063c01","n":"0063c","t":"主明不六六即是申於世諦明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0064a01","n":"0064a","t":"云四大非眼見云何生眼見也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0064b01","n":"0064b","t":"能見若言是他而能見者眼何"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0064c01","n":"0064c","t":"言眼定是見義也六者顛倒品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0065a01","n":"0065a","t":"見尚無有見色體非見云何能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0065b01","n":"0065b","t":"者無見有者故無是離也見可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0065c01","n":"0065c","t":"生此偈即明破六情之大意也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0066a01","n":"0066a","t":"生外人舉現事去來證有萬法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0066b01","n":"0066b","t":"涅槃云觀察五陰如五旃陀羅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0066c01","n":"0066c","t":"陰為四相刀切之違其住性故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0067a01","n":"0067a","t":"兩偈有因無因門破第三一偈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0067b01","n":"0067b","t":"若離色因有色下生第二偈故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0067c01","n":"0067c","t":"邪見品末炎及之耳復次現事"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0068a01","n":"0068a","t":"相所遷是共有因三從業起果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0068b01","n":"0068b","t":"言都無耶若都無因果墮邪見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0068c01","n":"0068c","t":"歎空又外人以有身心故受論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0069a01","n":"0069a","t":"有所依言有所當故答不成答"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0069b01","n":"0069b","t":"生時種種因不失故瓶是常百"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0069c01","n":"0069c","t":"中觀論疏卷第五本釋吉藏撰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0070a01","n":"0070a","t":"度論云愛見等者從無相門入"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0070b01","n":"0070b","t":"深照之問六種五陰云何同異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0070c01","n":"0070c","t":"明立相義也上以立有故論主"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0071a01","n":"0071a","t":"釋上半無法者至第二偈方釋"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0071b01","n":"0071b","t":"釋前偈下半上半明有無二門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0071c01","n":"0071c","t":"相即無二者若就標相作相待"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0072a01","n":"0072a","t":"謂為空無此諸物故得此空三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0072b01","n":"0072b","t":"知虛空下第二類破五種上三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0072c01","n":"0072c","t":"意云世人又盡見五種為有虛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0073a01","n":"0073a","t":"結得失智者見諸法生此第二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0073b01","n":"0073b","t":"染染者品第六所以有此品來"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0073c01","n":"0073c","t":"斷煩惱亦不與俱乃可取食明"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0074a01","n":"0074a","t":"何斷惑皆是除糞答大乘經論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0074b01","n":"0074b","t":"悲空觀人即見其空故境不定"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0074c01","n":"0074c","t":"染是三毒初故又生死本際有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0075a01","n":"0075a","t":"人體因人起於染用後半行雙"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0075b01","n":"0075b","t":"一時有要因煩惱而有於身終"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0075c01","n":"0075c","t":"脫復次今當以一異法破下第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0076a01","n":"0076a","t":"為人伴此親伴也因六根六塵"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0076b01","n":"0076b","t":"又成論師云境無淺深生滅智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0076c01","n":"0076c","t":"不出前後一時及上離伴等異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0077a01","n":"0077a","t":"法體有法體故有名字法體既"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0077b01","n":"0077b","t":"法體外無別有相即法起為生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0077c01","n":"0077c","t":"本性空今令其信三相本性自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0078a01","n":"0078a","t":"初長行立次偈破就立中通是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0078b01","n":"0078b","t":"三也下半破生是無為有三失"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0078c01","n":"0078c","t":"是故開諸門破三相也又執有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0079a01","n":"0079a","t":"云即時生老病死此是佛說四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0079b01","n":"0079b","t":"汝生是有為云何不備三耶若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0079c01","n":"0079c","t":"云至竟無能生用離等侶故又"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0080a01","n":"0080a","t":"內外並無通矣問曰下別破三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0080b01","n":"0080b","t":"大生具四相者為小生生之故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0080c01","n":"0080c","t":"說也又八相有二義一者體同"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0081a01","n":"0081a","t":"能生本生何因乃云本生不能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0081b01","n":"0081b","t":"半破上半牒二義若生生生時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0081c01","n":"0081c","t":"生今就譬說門破生即一切生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0082a01","n":"0082a","t":"未兩關未生即有所照暗無能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0082b01","n":"0082b","t":"近不破遠亦應破遠不破近也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0082c01","n":"0082c","t":"不破暗即四偈都辨明不破暗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0083a01","n":"0083a","t":"者第二三時門破有此偈來凡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0083b01","n":"0083b","t":"有此一破凡有二義一逆取外"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0083c01","n":"0083c","t":"無癡即是癡以未即是無之異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0084a01","n":"0084a","t":"破四無依破初一是奪謂無有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0084b01","n":"0084b","t":"立四者汝遂避三時即墮無為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0084c01","n":"0084c","t":"三是以下半明生相與時亦寂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0085a01","n":"0085a","t":"本寂滅即是實相波若如斯而"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0085b01","n":"0085b","t":"有若不因是豈得有非故非無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0085c01","n":"0085c","t":"人破成論云若未來體無既生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0086a01","n":"0086a","t":"窮下半將法從相即法墮自然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0086b01","n":"0086b","t":"滅不滅破第二偈偏釋初偈下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0086c01","n":"0086c","t":"於小住故名異法問何故並稱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0087a01","n":"0087a","t":"時故名異時既是想取假名時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0087b01","n":"0087b","t":"以理也如前說無有無相法者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0087c01","n":"0087c","t":"乃至四緣去來六情五陰等皆"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0088a01","n":"0088a","t":"三相也其心異者凡夫說三聞"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0089a01","n":"0089a","t":"中觀論疏卷第六本釋吉藏撰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0089b01","n":"0089b","t":"文也又前周約說門次第多從"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0089c01","n":"0089c","t":"陰之流二從人受稱如本住品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0090a01","n":"0090a","t":"倒事恒現故舉現事問也作是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0090b01","n":"0090b","t":"作義下半人法俱無亦無作義"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0090c01","n":"0090c","t":"更作復何須假業而成耶業二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0091a01","n":"0091a","t":"無為業成業半有能成人業半"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0091b01","n":"0091b","t":"二初偈明一人不能作三業次"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0091c01","n":"0091c","t":"世諦中道今明因緣人法即是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0092a01","n":"0092a","t":"非即非離一切諸我今此一品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0092b01","n":"0092b","t":"言都無人法今實有人名為本"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0092c01","n":"0092c","t":"相次偈竝體三徵宗既立離陰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0093a01","n":"0093a","t":"門破無我次取意以苦義顯無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0093b01","n":"0093b","t":"故生此問也答中上半牒宗下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0093c01","n":"0093c","t":"過如就眼中既能見色聞聲即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0094a01","n":"0094a","t":"無也今明若如數論決定執者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0094b01","n":"0094b","t":"由四大成色陰有色陰故成人"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0094c01","n":"0094c","t":"二種就上諸品破之三者自有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0095a01","n":"0095a","t":"長行為四一立二破三救四破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0095b01","n":"0095b","t":"失一者道理實有強破令無則"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0095c01","n":"0095c","t":"中觀論疏卷第六本畢中觀論"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0096a01","n":"0096a","t":"斷則賓主杜默何所論耶今諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0096b01","n":"0096b","t":"假即破中道又若見因緣名見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0096c01","n":"0096c","t":"處處皆離一處為薪處一處為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0097a01","n":"0097a","t":"云既不因薪火則常燃何假將"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0097b01","n":"0097b","t":"之火以燒離火之薪名可燃者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0097c01","n":"0097c","t":"此為疎密相待若長短相待名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0098a01","n":"0098a","t":"實不在餘處豈在前耶餘處者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0098b01","n":"0098b","t":"何以知破待成答偈云若法有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0098c01","n":"0098c","t":"法互待則俱無兩因俱無二果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0099a01","n":"0099a","t":"續待為用也今次責之未待有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0099b01","n":"0099b","t":"不異若已異即已應能燒即無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0099c01","n":"0099c","t":"同第二句破也問何故說燃可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0100a01","n":"0100a","t":"悉是一相一味之法究竟涅槃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0100b01","n":"0100b","t":"有我體故不即陰由陰合而生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0100c01","n":"0100c","t":"猶是有漏取其生心動念即名"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0101a01","n":"0101a","t":"也問云何破之答生死有始即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0101b01","n":"0101b","t":"也有生死者有法也以何因緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0101c01","n":"0101c","t":"生死之始而正觀不現故是涅"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0102a01","n":"0102a","t":"有明義一本有二死有三中有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0102b01","n":"0102b","t":"法次偈破法破法二意一明無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0102c01","n":"0102c","t":"答一云三界皆有苦受故皆是"},{"h":"ht