{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0161a01","n":"0161a","t":"空一者有所無空謂無明不可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0161b01","n":"0161b","t":"智度論云愛多者從果觀見老"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0161c01","n":"0161c","t":"無分別中善分別故欲令虛妄"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0162a01","n":"0162a","t":"是故互說問何故言無明緣行"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0162b01","n":"0162b","t":"識支攝也以有識著故下第四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0162c01","n":"0162c","t":"也答雖是相應共起法但觸為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0163a01","n":"0163a","t":"支謂能有來果名之為有又能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0163b01","n":"0163b","t":"八耶答過去已滅未來未起用"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0163c01","n":"0163c","t":"答觸受二果在胎外餘三在內"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0164a01","n":"0164a","t":"所作因為因緣也行生識者所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0164b01","n":"0164b","t":"果晈然故破疑心倚此身慢他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0164c01","n":"0164c","t":"後乃至涅槃名破邪見問大小"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0165a01","n":"0165a","t":"本今正伐其本支末自傾又一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0165b01","n":"0165b","t":"問經何故云我見攝六十二見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0165c01","n":"0165c","t":"冥漠難知故須別立現在顯了"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0166a01","n":"0166a","t":"常亦無常亦有亦無二句此三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0166b01","n":"0166b","t":"無常今身既是我便都無有我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0166c01","n":"0166c","t":"我受天身下三合譬是事不然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0167a01","n":"0167a","t":"下第二遮通遮通者外云汝若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0167b01","n":"0167b","t":"為無耳不言過去都無有我現"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0167c01","n":"0167c","t":"牒明墮常過者上四偈言奪破"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0168a01","n":"0168a","t":"非常猶在故非無常是故今偈"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0168b01","n":"0168b","t":"門初五偈破邊無邊二句次三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0168c01","n":"0168c","t":"環物多計之常故偏破眾生復"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0169a01","n":"0169a","t":"者一乘一乘最勝前兩品明小"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T42n1824_p0169b01","n":"0169b","t":"經亦明三義初標宗稱歎致敬"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T42n1824-中觀論疏","source":"CBETA T42n1824 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":504,"unit":"T42 頁欄"}